## Model setup for Agent plugins (ADR-0129)

agent-models-not-installed = This Agent isn't installed, or it has no such Bot
agent-models-unsupported = This Agent can't be set up with a model in the App
agent-models-not-ready = This Bot isn't ready yet. Try again in a moment
agent-models-not-found = This provider or sign-in is gone. Start again
agent-models-upstream = The Agent ran into a problem with this request
agent-models-timeout = The Agent took too long to answer
agent-models-forbidden = You can't change this Bot's model
agent-models-invalid-input = Something you entered isn't right
agent-models-invalid-body = The request isn't in the expected format. The App and your home server may need updating
